        "Hall of fame pulled every set ever recorded and sorted in JavaScript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Where the cost still sits",
      "items": [
        "Every load is server rendered, so nothing here is cached",
        "The exercise list now loads when the editor dialog opens",
        "Each heaviest set is one row, ordered by weight and limited to one"
      ]
    }
